Sheaf Reader (束阅)
Copyright (c) 2026, simon2137

This project — Sheaf Reader (束阅), formerly published as "Fluent Reader for
HarmonyOS" — is an unofficial, community-made port of Fluent Reader to
HarmonyOS Next (ArkTS / ArkUI). It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by the original author or by Huawei.

Based on:
  Fluent Reader — https://github.com/yang991178/fluent-reader
  Copyright (c) 2020, Haoyuan Liu (yang991178)
  Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License (see LICENSE).

What is derived from the original project:
  * the application's behaviour, layout logic, data model and settings
    semantics, ported from its TypeScript/React sources;
  * the `en-US` / `zh-CN` message catalogues (the other 17 upstream locales
    were dropped), including the upstream message keys;
  * the strings, service integrations and keyboard shortcuts that the port
    reproduces in order to behave like the original.

What is not from the original project:
  * the name "Sheaf Reader" / "束阅", all ArkTS/ArkUI code in this repository
    (a re-implementation, not a transpilation), and the `com.sheafreader.app`
    bundle identifier;
  * the application launcher icons under `AppScope/resources` and
    `entry/src/main/resources/base/media/`, which are placeholders drawn for
    this port.

Renamed data markers (for anyone restoring an older backup):
  * the backup format marker is `sheaf-reader-hm`; the pre-rename marker
    `fluent-reader-hm` is still accepted on import.

Third-party components:
  * the 24x24 SVG icons under `entry/src/main/resources/base/media/` are icon
    path data from Material Design Icons (Google), used under the Apache
    License 2.0 — see `third_party/material-design-icons/`.

